{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-06",
  "title": "災難",
  "storyCode": "1-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "81eab53cd4cca7df41114777571fb88b161321a4a10d18b18144d797961e7ef5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "是的，他們不知道自己被浮士德跟蹤。我從浮士德派回來的斥候那裡瞭解到了一些情報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "羅德島確實被困在中城區的外圍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "雖然是些蟲子，但他們也可能趁著天災帶來混亂逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "以他們對切爾諾伯格現狀的瞭解，說不定會干擾到我們的計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "——至少，把他們剷除掉沒有任何壞處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格的混蛋，都是你們，都是你們，害得我們感染者變成這樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "閃開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "嗚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "這些人，只不過是在前仆後繼地送死！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "整合運動怎麼全都陷入了狂躁狀態？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "為什麼這個時候，這裡會聚集著這麼多整合運動？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不合常理！整合運動根本沒有堅守這裡的理由！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "羅德島幹員們，不要退縮！擊退整合運動，打開撤退路徑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "那些人就是情報中說的“羅德島”？呵......很英勇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "......落石？這個時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "別停下！優先確保防線！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "不對......是砸在建築物上蹦出來的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "你在說什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "來了！來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "哈哈......我們感染者的救贖！普通人的末日！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊，啊啊——咕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊，啊啊——咕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "他是被什麼東西......擊倒的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "你們有誰......攻擊了他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "還是說，他是被......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "杜賓！天空......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "天空陷入了血色——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "“沸騰的烏雲翻湧在火焰之中......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "別驚慌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "保護好自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......我們還有機會，用行動去拯救自己的生命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“——大地陷入寂靜，恐懼取走了他們的聲音。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“巨大的源石垂下頭顱——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“——墜落，它墜落在死亡焦熱的陰影。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————也許他們能自天災中倖存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "漏網之人，你去處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "雖然已經想到，整合運動要利用天災復仇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "沒想到，他們居然會選擇讓天災徹底毀滅切爾諾伯格——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "比起報復，這更像是宣誓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "感染者的時代......嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "啊......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "整個天空......都要掉下來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "小心！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "清醒點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "保護醫生，快帶她去安全的地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "幹員們，各自尋找安全位置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "各小隊！準備好......應對天災！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
